# Mobile UI — WHYP Taxi

Reference apps: **Uber**, **Lyft**, **Curb**. Never an admin dashboard.

## Use the design system, don't re-invent it

Import from `@/components/ui`. Never hand-roll a nav bar, card, list row, input, or button.

| Need | Component |
|---|---|
| Screen header | `NavBar` (title, `onBack`, `right`) |
| Round header action | `NavIconButton` |
| Grouped container | `Card` + `Divider inset={52}` |
| Any tappable row | `ListRow` |
| Group label | `SectionHeader` |
| Text input | `TextField` (has label, hint, error) |
| Tier / mode switch | `SegmentedControl` |
| Numeric picker | `Stepper` |
| Status pill | `Badge` |
| Actions | `Button` |

Tokens live in `@/constants/theme`: `spacing`, `borderRadius`, `typography`, `elevation(colors, level)`.

## Theming is mandatory

- Style with `useThemedStyles(createStyles)` + `createStyles(colors: ThemeColors)`. Never `StyleSheet.create` at module scope with colors.
- Never import the deprecated `colors` export — it is light-only and silently breaks dark mode.
- Never hardcode a hex value in a screen or component.

## Layout

- **Every horizontal row**: `flexDirection: "row"`, `alignItems: "center"`, `justifyContent: "space-between"`, `width: "100%"`. Pressable rows also need `alignSelf: "stretch"` or they collapse into a vertical stack.
- Text blocks in rows: `flex: 1`, `minWidth: 0`, plus `numberOfLines` so the trailing icon stays pinned right.
- Fixed-size elements next to flexible ones need `flexShrink: 0`.
- **One primary action per screen.** No logos or role switchers on flow screens.
- Section titles are **sentence case** ("Saved places"). Never ALL CAPS, never `textTransform: "uppercase"`.
- Screen padding is `spacing.md` horizontally; separate blocks with `gap: spacing.md`.

## Map screens

Map fills the top, a rounded bottom sheet (`borderRadius.xxl` top corners, `elevation lg`) holds the content with a drag handle. Header buttons float over the map via `NavIconButton`.

## Address entry

One trip card: pickup dot, connector line, dropoff square, fields divided by a hairline. No separate "PICKUP"/"DROPOFF" labels. Map picker is a `ListRow`, never orphan link text.

## Visual

- Primary CTA: brand fill, `size="lg"` (56px). Disabled = gray fill with muted text, never white-on-white.
- Icons: Lucide at 20px, `strokeWidth 1.75`, muted gray in a 40px circle.
- Accent color is `colors.brand`. Gold is reserved for star ratings only.
- Prefer one elevation or one hairline border per surface, never both.

## Interaction

- Every `Pressable` gets a visible pressed state and `accessibilityRole` + `accessibilityLabel`.
- Fire `haptics` from `@/lib/haptics`: `select()` on choice, `tap()` on navigation, `success()` on confirm, `warning()` on validation failure.

## Before shipping UI

- [ ] Any duplicate sections merged?
- [ ] Readable in both light and dark?
- [ ] Scannable in 3 seconds?
- [ ] `npx tsc --noEmit` clean?
